WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.636
Regular polygons have every side equal and every interior angle equal; otherwise they

00:00:05.636 --> 00:00:06.472
are irregular.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:12.903
Name a 4-sided polygon. The answer is quadrilateral. A polygon with 4 sides has this

00:00:12.903 --> 00:00:13.278
name.

00:00:14.117 --> 00:00:18.923
A regular polygon for a school fundraiser has 6 equal sides and angles. What is the

00:00:18.923 --> 00:00:21.626
name of its shape? Pause the video and think.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:27.485
A regular polygon for a school fundraiser has 6 equal sides and angles. What is the

00:00:27.485 --> 00:00:32.519
name of its shape? The answer is hexagon. A polygon with 6 sides has this name.
